2. THE REGISTER — CC BY 4.0, WITH ONE CARVE-OUT

data.js, research-designs.js and intake/ledger.json: the selection,
arrangement, descriptions, verification notes and generated study
designs are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

THE CARVE-OUT. Each record quotes one sentence from a published paper,
in gap_evidence.note, to report what that paper claimed. Those sentences
are NOT the author's to license. They remain the copyright of their
publishers and authors, are reproduced here in short quotation with a
citation and a link to the source, and any reuse of them is a matter
between you and the rights holder. intake/validate.mjs enforces a
maximum length on them.


